  policy ReadModelsDestroyedMootsErasedGaps  // S:817 "ReadModelsDestroyed (an entry-scope or document-scope erasure) → MootGap"; row S:817 "ReadModelsDestroyed (an entry-scope or document-scope erasure) → MootGap(cause: Erased) for each Gap any of whose origins' entry or section is in the erased scope" // board: P3-78
